            "text": "A simpler trigger, through the exported `recordGraphics()` and without a file: an error in the recorded expression leaves the device locked in the same way. If you prefer it, this form of the regression test also fails on r90922 and passes with the patch:\n\n```r\n## an error in recordGraphics() left the device locked -- PR#19335\npdf(NULL)\ntry(recordGraphics(stop(\"boom\"), list(), globalenv()), silent = TRUE)\nw <- NULL\nwithCallingHandlers(dev.off(), warning = function(e) {\n    w <<- conditionMessage(e)\n    invokeRestart(\"muffleWarning\")\n})\nstopifnot(is.null(w))\n## dev.off() warned \"Killing locked device\" in R <= 4.6.*\n```",
            "bug_id": 19335,
